{"id":32014389452,"name":"Test","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAHdDTQzA","head_branch":"fix/2.41-replicateuser-orgunit-drop-clean","head_sha":"d6fb88eb387a8a008e01ef8a8122229faafba88b","path":".github/workflows/run-tests.yml","run_number":55671,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"fix: force-initialize collections dropped by replicateUser's uninitialized-proxy merge skip","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":10954,"check_suite_id":86790408790,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAUNRyKVg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32014389452","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32014389452","created_at":"2026-08-17T09:16:43Z","updated_at":"2026-08-17T09:29:26Z","run_started_at":"2026-08-17T09:16:43Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32014389452/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32014389452/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/86790408790","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32014389452/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32014389452/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32014389452/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: force-initialize userRoles and dimension-constraint collections too\n\nSame defect as the org-unit fix: DefaultMetadataMergeService.merge() silently\nskips any collection still uninitialized at merge time. userRoles,\ncogsDimensionConstraints, and catDimensionConstraints have no explicit\nre-copy step (unlike groups, which is re-established separately via\naddUserToGroups()), so they're exposed to the same silent-drop bug -\nuserRoles being the most severe, since it would leave a replicated user with\nno authorities at all.\n\nAdded red-\u003egreen tests for both. Note: an earlier draft of each test passed\neven without the fix, because the test code itself touched the source user's\ncollection within the same Hibernate session the replication request later\nreused, accidentally pre-initializing it. Rewrote both to go through real\nPATCH requests instead of direct service calls, which is what actually\nproduced honest failures - this is also the likely explanation for why this\nbug reproduces inconsistently across environments in general (session/first-\nlevel-cache sharing, not caching config or timing).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"d6fb88eb387a8a008e01ef8a8122229faafba88b","tree_id":"5e44a7909f13962ce1a2c93290ee4a9af6228c22","timestamp":"2026-08-17T09:16:27Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contai